    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Well, I don't know. I said that, uh, I predicted, uh, because the book was written, uh, uh, except for the, the epilogue was written prior to, uh, the January 6th, uh, uh, insurrection. And I said in the book, though, on projecting forward that Trump would do exactly what he's doing. Lady would set up an operation and continue to be a pain, instead of a royal one, to try to influence the outcome of anything in the Senate, not in my opinion, not in a positive way. And so I also said that he's going to talk about running again, and he has, whether he will or not, I think is up in the air, but what's not up in the air is whether he's trying to influence the outcome of any kind of legislation or any direction the company the country is taking.",
