    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/9/79438.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "Well, the 20 years have had a lot of what I would say time filled with wars and protecting this country from further attacks, from outside sources. And I must say that overall, in terms of keeping the mainland here, the dark country, three for those attacks has been largely successful. And so so much of it was involved in security, making sure that people back home were secure. And to try to make the rest of the world to the extent we could more secure.",
